### Page 1 of 1

```text
RESOLUTION NO. __________

ENTITLED: “A RESOLUTION AUTHORIZING THE DOWNTOWN DEVELOPMENT
AUTHORITY (DDA) TO GENERATE REVENUE FOR GENERAL
OPERATING FUNDS.”

WHEREAS, the Downtown Development Authority (DDA) was created pursuant to Wyo.
Stat. § 15-9-201, et seq., and Chapter 2.76 of the Cheyenne City Code; and

WHEREAS, structural budget shortfalls threaten the DDA’s service delivery and quality
and have already resulted in the pause of some services like the Façade Improvement Program;
and

WHEREAS, continued growth within the DDA district has increased expectations for
service delivery amid tight budgets; and

WHEREAS, the DDA has identified revenue diversification as a goal for 2021 in its
strategic planning meetings as a viable mechanism to begin addressing gaps in resources; and

WHEREAS, diversification of revenue sources will improve the sustainability of the DDA
in the future; and

WHEREAS, the DDA has identified opportunities for revenue diversification including,
but not limited to, selling advertising space on the DDA’s website and in the Visitor’s Guide to
Downtown Cheyenne, selling Downtown Cheyenne Destination apparel and merchandise, and
selling event sponsorships, among other revenue generating efforts; and

WHEREAS, these revenue diversification resources provide for scalability over the long
term; and

WHEREAS, Wyo. Stat. § 15-9-218, et seq., requires approval of the Governing Body to
engage in revenue generation beyond that specifically identified in Statute.

NOW, THEREFORE, BE IT RESOLVED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE CITY
OF CHEYENNE, WYOMING, that the Governing Body of the City of Cheyenne authorizes the
DDA to engage in activities such as those described above, among others, to generate revenue to
offset the costs of services and for the DDA’s operations.

PRESENTED, READ, AND ADOPTED this ______ day of _________________, 2021.

__________________________________________

Patrick Collins, Mayor
(SEAL)
Attest:

__________________________________
Kristina F. Jones, City Clerk
By Alessandra at 12:51 pm, May 03, 2021
```
